// The executable's icon, as Windows Explorer and the taskbar show it.
//
// A flat-shaded low-poly propeller plane over a dusk sea, in the style of the
// launcher's background. tools/make_logo.py draws it from polygons at each
// standard icon size (16 through 256), so it stays crisp at every size Explorer
// uses; rerun that script after changing the artwork. The .ico is committed.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "../assets/AppIcon.ico"
